# What `railway up` must NOT carry to the builder.
#
# `railway up` ships the working tree, not a commit (there is still no git
# remote), so everything tracked goes over the wire on every deploy. None of
# the below is read at runtime or at build time by `pnpm build`.
#
# This file exists because an upload timed out: committing the design exports
# put 7MB of PNG and vendored browser bundles into a payload that until then
# had been source only. The deploy FAILED while the health check stayed green
# on the previous release, which is a failure mode worth knowing about — a
# timed-out `railway up` exits 0.

# Design sources: exports, their browser runtime, fonts for the web build are
# in src/, not here. Read by humans and by `pnpm design:decode`.
design/

# The Expo app is built by EAS, never by Railway.
mobile/

# Local-only.
*.apk
.eas-token
